Steps to run:
1. Start Apache and MySQL in XAMPP.
2. Open http://localhost/phpmyadmin and run the SQL setup.
3. Save db.php, index.php, and view.php in C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\FeedbackSystem.
4. Visit http://localhost/FeedbackSystem/index.php and submit feedback.
5. Select View Feedback to see stored records.
